am/apps/2859230/extras/2836ce0a6c9e5258811c27e87cf14e4d.webp?t=1752585428\" width=226 height=46 /></span><br>-Player will Be the First Zombie .In the Zombie Base Camp,Player will be Shown A Map ,Displaying How each Area Infection Rate is.And current Zombie Population will Increase acordingly base on Infection Rate.When hit Start Button,A Ramdon Level will Start.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/5a30ae65d9f484c5b2f720aa502df812.poster.avif?t=1752585428\" width=590 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/5a30ae65d9f484c5b2f720aa502df812.webm?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/5a30ae65d9f484c5b2f720aa502df812.mp4?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- In Each Level.Player will Controll the Alpha Zombie to Attack Citizens in a limited Space and Time.Once human is  Infected ,They  Soon turn into A Zombie and Start Attacking others Humanbeing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/b5cea2194156bcea6e25e196d19cb93a.poster.avif?t=1752585428\" width=590 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/b5cea2194156bcea6e25e196d19cb93a.webm?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/b5cea2194156bcea6e25e196d19cb93a.mp4?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>-In the end of level,Zombie infection Rate will increse Base on Level Score.<br>-As Zombie Population Grows,Player will gain more BRAIN POWER to Unlock More Zombie Class and Alpha Zombie Skills.<br>Fare Well,Alpha Zombie.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/68cc46f6e85fdef80b02fc26878d6c31.poster.avif?t=1752585428\" width=590 height=28 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/68cc46f6e85fdef80b02fc26878d6c31.webm?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859230/extras/68cc46f6e85fdef80b02fc26878d6c31.mp4?t=1752585428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
